OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as electric bike and
OL,4,Ascooter incidents rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn emergency services charity has urged
OL,7,Fe-bike and e-scooter users to "make
OL,8,Fevery journey a safe one".
OL,10,FSerious incidents involving the devices
OL,11,Fhave more than tripled, rising from
OL,12,Fseven in 2024/25 to 26 in 2025/25,
OL,13,Faccording to Air Ambulance Charity
OL,14,FKent, Surrey and Sussex (KSS).
OL,16,FNationally, there were 10 deaths
OL,17,Finvolving e-scooters last year, with
OL,18,Faround 484 people injured.
OL,20,F"We see the aftermath of serious road
OL,21,Ftraffic collisions across our region,"
OL,22,Fsaid Lynsey Grant from KSS.
